<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">Valuation techniques used to measure fair value maximize the use of relevant observable inputs and minimize the use of unobservable inputs (See Note 8). Our convertible notes are classified within Level&nbsp;3 of the fair value hierarchy because the fair value measurement is based, in part, on significant inputs not observed in the market.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">There were no transfers among Level 1, Level 2 or Level 3 categories in the six months ended June 30, 2023 or in the year ended December 31, 2022.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

