<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;">As of June 30, 2023, total unrecognized stock-based compensation related to unvested stock options issued was $340,812, which the Company expects to recognize over a remaining weighted-average period of 1.7 years. The Company records forfeitures as they occur.</p>

