			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b><b>Six Months Ended June 30, </b></b></p>
			</td>
			<td id=".trail.D3" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
